        "ACHIEVEMENT_ROB_HUNK_GUERRILLA_ACHIEVEMENT_ID_NAME": "HUNK: Locked and Loaded",
        "ACHIEVEMENT_ROB_HUNK_GUERRILLA_ACHIEVEMENT_ID_DESCRIPTION": "Играя за HUNK, получите полный арсенал.",
