        "ACHIEVEMENT_ROB_HUNK_INFINITEKNIFE_ACHIEVEMENT_ID_NAME": "HUNK: Ace of Spades",
        "ACHIEVEMENT_ROB_HUNK_INFINITEKNIFE_ACHIEVEMENT_ID_DESCRIPTION": "Играя за HUNK, носите с собой две карты-ключ-пики одновременно.",
